                                                "example_id": "058ceade-114c-4fad-9069-93addec4ec50",
                                                "sense_id": "103441dd-7749-3e1e-b3f3-adcbbeeccdd0",
                                                "text": "One of the primary objectives of the foreign policy of the United States is the creation of conditions in which we and other nations will be able to work out a way of life free from coercion."
